        formulas: ['η = xS·pf / (xS·pf + Pi + x²·Pcu)', 'Max η at x = √(Pi/Pcu)', 'Ns = 120·f/P,  s = (Ns − N)/Ns', 'Eb = V − Ia·Ra'],
